  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h2>1. Executive Overview</h2>

<p>This report analyzes <strong>{n} monthly observations</strong> of global crude oil prices from <strong>{first_date}</strong> through <strong>{last_date}</strong>, spanning approximately <strong>{years_elapsed:.1f} years</strong>. Over this half-century window, crude oil has undergone a profound structural transformation — from the tightly regulated, low-price environment of the early 1970s (opening at ${fmt(prices[0])}/bbl) to the volatile, geopolitically sensitive market of the 2020s (closing at ${fmt(prices[-1])}/bbl).</p>

<div class="kpi-grid">
  <div class="kpi-card">
    <div class="kpi-label">Overall Price Range</div>
    <div class="kpi-value">${fmt(price_range)}</div>
    <div class="kpi-unit">USD per barrel</div>
