</div>

<!-- ── LONG-TERM TREND ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<h2>2. Long-Term Price Trajectory (1970–2026)</h2>

<div class="chart-container">
  <div class="chart-title">Monthly Crude Oil Price (USD/bbl) — Full Time Series</div>
