</div>

<p>The full time series reveals <strong>four distinct price regimes</strong>:</p>

<table>
<thead><tr><th>Regime</th><th>Approx. Period</th><th>Price Range</th><th>Characteristic</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>Pre-Crisis Stability</strong></td><td>1970–1973</td><td>$1.21–$4.10</td><td>Low, tightly regulated prices under the posted-price system</td></tr>
